B.FG=new A.c3("Give them insulin immediately",!1,"No! They're having low blood sugar. Insulin would make it worse.")
B.FJ=new A.c3("Give them orange juice or glucose tablets",!0,"Correct! Fast-acting sugar helps raise blood glucose quickly.")
B.FA=new A.c3("Tell them to exercise",!1,"Exercise would lower blood sugar further - dangerous in this situation.")
