B.Fv=new A.c3("Take rapid-acting insulin and drink water, check for ketones",!0,"Correct! High glucose with nausea and fruity breath may indicate DKA risk.")
B.Ft=new A.c3("Go to sleep and check in the morning",!1,"This could be diabetic ketoacidosis - a medical emergency!")
